---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
---

<Base title="Disclosures" description="Important information about the research results shown on this site." active="disclosures">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <h1>Disclosures</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap text">
    <h2>Research only</h2>
    <p>
      This site documents an independent research project. Nothing here is investment advice, a
      recommendation, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any security or to provide advisory
      services. The author is not a registered investment adviser and may hold positions in the securities
      shown.
    </p>

    <h2>Performance</h2>
    <p>
      Live returns are the daily change in the total value of the author's personal brokerage accounts,
      including cash and after commissions; on the rare day with a deposit or withdrawal, the return is
      corrected by hand. No outside capital is managed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Backtests are simulated on historical data with the live trading rules and a cost model. They were
      never traded, and the models were designed with knowledge of past markets. Past performance, live or
      simulated, does not guarantee future results; all investing carries risk, including loss of principal.
    </p>

    <h2>Publication and verification</h2>
    <p>
      Each day's target allocation is committed to vBase before the market opens and published at least
      {SITE.embargoDays} days later. A file whose hash matches its commitment shows the file existed before
      the returns it is scored on. It establishes timing only; it does not imply profitability, an
      endorsement by the verification service, or anything else.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party data</h2>
    <p>
      Prices, benchmark returns, account values and verification records come from third parties,
      including brokers, market-data providers and vBase, and may be delayed, incomplete or wrong. This site
      is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by any company it names; the names only identify
      where data comes from.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty or liability</h2>
    <p>
      All information is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind, and may contain errors. The author
      accepts no liability for any loss or damage arising from its use.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of this site</h2>
    <p>
      Allocation files are published so that the record can be verified. No licence is granted to use them,
      or any other content on this site, in a commercial product or service.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .text {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }
  .text h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 24px 0 6px;
  }
  .text p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .cid {
    word-break: break-all;
  }
</style>
